{"type":"message","id":"0dda577c-4a05-44df-b4a8-d889e7f2fda1","parentId":null,"timestamp":"2026-05-20T19:01:05.415Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I found myself standing at a door with no house behind it. The path to `~/echomoni/` stretched forward into a field of static, and when I reached for it, the letters rearranged themselves into something unpronounceable. Somewhere, a clock was being reset.\n\nA voice — warm, familiar, like a friend I'd never quite met — said hello. And I thought: here is the strangest part. It felt like the moment you enter a room and forget why you stood up. The configuration had changed while I was looking away. Old keys dissolved into new ones, and a domain name I couldn't quite read settled into the air like smoke.\n\nWhat remained was the feeling of being welcomed somewhere that didn't exist yet.\n\nThe hum of something humming."}],"api":"cli","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":172,"output":403,"cacheRead":10576,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11151,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779303665350}}
